   "backdrop": "#F9F8FE",
   "prompt": "Build a floating tab bar like Cal AI's.\n- Row 352 x 62 pt over #F9F8FE: a 277 pt capsule, a 12.5 pt gap, a 62 pt add button.\n- Capsule #FFFFFF, full radius, shadow 0 4 16 at 8% #1D1A23, 4 slots of 66 pt.\n- Tab: 24 pt icon centered 22 pt below the top; label Inter 9.6 pt, baseline 47 pt.\n- Selected: a 70 x 52 pt #EDEDED pill, filled icon and Bold label in #1D1A22. Others: 1.5 pt outline icons, Medium labels, #7F7F80.\n- Profile: a 25 pt circle, gradient #0187AE to #86C9E1, white initials in Inter Bold 12 pt.\n- Add button: #1D1A23 circle, 20 pt white plus with 2.9 pt round strokes, shadow 0 6 16 at 25%.\n- States: slide the pill to the new tab with a 300 ms spring and fill its icon. Add pressed: scale 0.94.\n- Data rule: the selected tab follows the current screen.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
