   "why": "A 37 pt count (1250 of 2500) and a ring closed halfway show the day's calorie budget in 1 glance.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card\"><div class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card__card\"><div class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card__count\"><span class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card__eaten\">1250</span><span class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card__goal\">/2500</span></div><span class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card__label\">Calories eaten</span><svg class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card__ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 90.4 90.4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"45.2\" cy=\"45.2\" r=\"41.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAE9EF\" stroke-width=\"6.8\"/><circle cx=\"45.2\" cy=\"45.2\" r=\"41.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1D1A23\" stroke-width=\"6.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"131.32 999\" transform=\"rotate(-90 45.2 45.2)\"/></svg><svg class=\"x-cal-ai-calorie-card__flame\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.4 0.1C6.8 0.8 11.6 3.8 14.6 8.2C16.3 10.8 16.2 15 14 17.4C12.3 19.2 10.2 20 8 20C5.6 20 3.2 19 1.6 17.2C-0.2 15 -0.1 11.5 1.4 8.6C1.6 7.4 1.6 6.6 1.5 5.6C2.3 6.3 3.4 7.4 4.2 8.2C4.4 5.4 3.8 2.6 2.4 0.1Z\" fill=\"#1D1A23\"/><path d=\"M7.2 8.4C7.8 10 10.4 11.6 10.6 14.6C10.8 16.3 9.6 17.5 7.9 17.5C6.1 17.5 4.9 16.2 5 14.6C5.1 13.4 5.8 12.6 6.5 11.8C7.1 11 7.3 9.8 7.2 8.4Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></svg></div></div>",
   "css": ".x-cal-ai-calorie-card{box-sizing:border-box;width:377px;padding:16px;font-family:\"Inter\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;letter-spacing:0;color:#1D1A23;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card__card{position:relative;width:344.8px;height:116.9px;border-radius:20px;background:#FFFFFF;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(29,26,35,0.08),0 0 0 1px rgba(29,26,35,0.03)}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card__count{position:absolute;left:21.7px;top:33.63px;display:flex;align-items:baseline}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card__eaten{display:block;font-size:36.8px;font-weight:600;line-height:36.8px;letter-spacing:0.012em}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card__goal{display:block;margin-left:1.2px;font-size:15px;line-height:15px;color:#7F7F7F}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card__label{position:absolute;left:22px;top:76.34px;display:block;font-size:11.3px;line-height:11.3px;color:#808081}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card__ring{position:absolute;left:227.3px;top:13.1px;display:block;width:90.4px;height:90.4px}.x-cal-ai-calorie-card__flame{position:absolute;left:265px;top:48.6px;display:block;width:16px;height:20px}",
   "fonts": [
    {
     "family": "Inter",
     "weight": 400
    },
    {
     "family": "Inter",
     "weight": 600
    }
   ],
   "size": {
    "w": 377,
    "h": 149
   },
   "backdrop": null,
   "prompt": "Build a calorie ring card like Cal AI's.\n- Card 345 x 117 pt, #FFFFFF, 20 pt radius, shadow 0 2 10 at 8% #1D1A23 plus a 1 pt ring at 3%.\n- Count: eaten in Inter SemiBold 37 pt #1D1A23 at x 22 pt, baseline 65 pt, then \"/goal\" in Inter Regular 15 pt #7F7F7F on the same baseline.\n- Label \"Calories eaten\": Inter Regular 11.3 pt #808081, baseline 85 pt.\n- Ring: 90 pt wide, 6.8 pt stroke, #EAE9EF track, #1D1A23 arc with round caps from 12 o'clock clockwise. It sits 27 pt from the right edge, centered vertically.\n- Center: a 15.5 x 20 pt filled flame in #1D1A23 with a white inner flame.\n- Data rule: arc length = eaten / goal (50% here), capped at 100%.\n- States: on load, sweep the arc from 0 over 600 ms ease-out and count the number up.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  },
