   },
   "backdrop": "#FFFFFF",
   "prompt": "Build a pair of result buttons like Cal AI's.\n- Row 341 x 48 pt, 26 pt from each screen edge, on #FFFFFF: two 165 x 48 pt capsules, 10 pt apart.\n- Secondary (left): #FFFFFF fill, 1 pt #D6D5DB border, a 15 pt 4-point sparkle in #1D1B21, an 11.6 pt gap, then \"Fix Results\". The group is centered.\n- Primary (right): #1D1A23 fill, \"Done\" in #FFFFFF, centered.\n- Labels: Inter Medium 16 pt, on the pill's center line.\n- States: pressed scales to 0.97 over 120 ms. Done pressed: #000000. Fix Results pressed: fill #F4F4F6.\n- Data rule: Done saves the scanned meal; Fix Results opens the editor with the AI's values filled in.\n- Both are 48 pt tall, above the 44 pt tap minimum.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  }
